title: Two things that misled me.
pid: 1fab6521-a84c-4a98-9cf7-e90904232ee9
body: |2-
  - skg-for-ai marks a link it cannot resolve on MY server '⟦✗ missing⟧'. Seen
    through my server, Jeff's links into his private skgrepos all read missing;
    that says nothing about his buffer.
  - Jeff's Emacs runs outside the container, so there is no client log to read,
    and his folds reach the server only in a save.
